{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02345",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 4.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.94,
      "end_seconds": 10.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.4,
      "end_seconds": 16.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Yeah, it's itchy spots all over. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.61,
      "end_seconds": 26.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.42,
      "end_seconds": 33.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "It feels moderate to me. It's a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.23,
      "end_seconds": 38.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Right, have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.87,
      "end_seconds": 60.55,
      "duration_seconds": 21.68,
      "text": "A mild temperature goes along with it, most of the time. And, And I've been feeling achy as well. About feeling achy, it feels severe to me. I'd say once or twice a day. The mild temperature? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.85,
      "end_seconds": 66.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Have you had any stiff neck, breathlessness, being immunosuppressed or pregnancy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.78,
      "end_seconds": 71.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Right, you know, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.03,
      "end_seconds": 76.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.29,
      "end_seconds": 80.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.73,
      "end_seconds": 86.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.9,
      "end_seconds": 91.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.34,
      "end_seconds": 95.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.81,
      "end_seconds": 101.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I've had migraines for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.77,
      "end_seconds": 124.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.55,
      "end_seconds": 133.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "I'm on something called suma... sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, maybe, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.85,
      "end_seconds": 139.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Right, did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.51,
      "end_seconds": 151.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.44,
      "text": "Right, not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's calamine lotion, when needed. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.3,
      "end_seconds": 156.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.72,
      "end_seconds": 162.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.42,
      "end_seconds": 182.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.43,
      "end_seconds": 197.36,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.51,
      "end_seconds": 218.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.56,
      "end_seconds": 222.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Erm, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.17,
      "end_seconds": 226.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.94,
      "end_seconds": 235.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.36,
      "end_seconds": 259.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "Okay: temp 37.0 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air. And BP is 128 over 79, pulse is 73 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.28,
      "end_seconds": 261.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.13,
      "end_seconds": 265.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Okay, we'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.34,
      "end_seconds": 272.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.9,
      "end_seconds": 275.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.35,
      "end_seconds": 294.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "There are crops of blisters and scabs in different stages on the trunk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.64,
      "end_seconds": 334.13,
      "duration_seconds": 36.49,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, thinking it through, it points towards chickenpox. We shouldn't forget shingles. I'll start you on aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, seven days. It's for adult chickenpox. Stay at home until all the spots have crusted and stay away from pregnant women. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. We'll catch up if you become breathless."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.84,
      "end_seconds": 336.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.66,
      "end_seconds": 342.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.46,
      "end_seconds": 346.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "That's clear, you know, thanks."
    }
  ]
}